2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F8053%2F8053.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】河口湖温泉　うぶや の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">💡 特集に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            部屋から「逆さ富士」が最も綺麗に見えるエリアは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 河口湖北岸エリア（うぶや・秀峰閣湖月・KUKUNA等）は、遮るものが一切なく湖面に映る美しい逆さ富士を正面から望める特等席です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            富士山が綺麗に見える時間帯や季節は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 空気が澄み渡る晩秋から冬・早春（11月〜3月）の早朝（日の出直後から午前9時頃）が最もくっきりと雪化粧した富士山を拝めるベストタイミングです。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            記念日やプロポーズに人気の富士山ビュー宿は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 全室富士山を望むラグジュアリーリゾート『ふふ 河口湖』や、お祝いの宿として名高い『河口湖温泉 うぶや』が圧倒的な人気を誇ります。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！テーマ別＆全国厳選特集</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900\">💎 テーマ別キラー特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/mt-fuji-view-lake-kawaguchi-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 富士山が見える絶景温泉宿10選</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/okinawa-isolated-island-blue-beach-resort-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 宮古島・石垣島・奄美大島リゾート10選</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/beauty-skin-smooth-hotspring-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 日本三大美肌の湯＆とろとろ美容温泉10選</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900\">🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/yamanashi-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨 【山梨・富士河口湖】厳選10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/okinawa-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-oran